name pgfkeysearch
category Package
revision 69385
shortdesc This package offers a way to find keys in a given path 'recursively', unlike pgfkeysvalueof
relocated 1
longdesc The command \pgfkeysvalueof unlike other \pgfkeys commands,
longdesc doesn't have a .unknown handler, or offers the option to search
longdesc for a key. That's exactly the aim of this, by having a way to
longdesc find a key in a given path (or collection of paths).
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/pgfkeysearch/pgfkeysearch.sty
